  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mn>4</mn></math> distinct numbers are chosen randomly from the first <math><mn>100</mn></math> natural numbers, then the probability that all <math><mn>4</mn></math> of them are either divisible by <math><mn>3</mn></math> or divisible by <math><mn>5</mn></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
