  "solution": {
    "text": "Total cases&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />Numbers which are divisible by either <math><mn>3</mn></math> or <math><mn>5</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∩</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>47</mn></math><br /><br />Favourable cases&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>47</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />Hence, required probability <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>47</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>"
